WEBVTT

00:10:27.616 --> 00:10:30.190
I'm so respectful about seeing what it is.

00:10:30.214 --> 00:10:33.021
And there came a time
about five or six years ago

00:10:33.045 --> 00:10:37.610
where I found myself just being really --
but not passionately -- interested,

00:10:37.634 --> 00:10:40.327
just kind of interested
in plants and gardening.

00:10:40.351 --> 00:10:42.008
I had just moved into a new house.

00:10:42.032 --> 00:10:45.707
It had a little bit of dirt in the back
that I was able to do something with,

00:10:45.731 --> 00:10:49.741
and I just started to explore it
and devote myself to it

00:10:49.765 --> 00:10:52.593
just in order to do it, you know?

00:10:52.617 --> 00:10:55.223
Not to become a professional landscaper,

00:10:55.247 --> 00:10:56.836
but just to see where it led me,

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:59.887
and I discovered over the course
of my first summer of gardening

00:10:59.911 --> 00:11:02.811
that I was a lot more interested
in the origins of the plants